// Module c-cvt-dissection: the less common vascular causes of stroke and headache, taught through
// the features that separate them from arterial ischemic stroke: cerebral venous thrombosis,
// cervical artery dissection, reversible cerebral vasoconstriction syndrome, and CNS vasculitis.

